{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UjthsNmoPY7z82isNhHF7Z","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Handover — 2026-05-21\n2\t\n3\t> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\n4\t\n5\t## 运行中\n6\t（无）\n7\t\n8\t## 待处理\n9\t（无）\n10\t\n11\t## 近期结论\n12\t- **mvp_003** (success): 同 mvp_002 DGP（c~HalfNormal(1.5), bimodal e, s~N(0,0.8), N=50, J=8, ρ=0.6），MCMC 调优（warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95, non-centered parameterization）后收敛达标（R̂<1.05, ESS>100）且 joint 显著优于 sequential。 ← 基于 mvp_002\n13\t- **mvp_002** (negative): 放大 contamination 信号（c~HalfNormal(1.5), bimodal e, s~N(0,0.8), N=50, J=8）后，joint G-MFRM 在 item-level + judge-level confounding (ρ=0.6) 下对 θ_true 的恢复精度显著优于 sequential pipeline。 ← 基于 mvp_001\n14\t- **mvp_001** (negative): 当 d_j 与 c_n·e_i 存在 confounding（item-level + judge-level, ρ>0）时，joint G-MFRM 对 θ_true 的恢复精度（RMSE）显著优于 sequential pipeline，因为 joint estimation 避免了 contamination 效应被 d̂_j 和 b̂_i 吸收。\n15\t  [diagnosis_bias_scatter](rtx6000-4x:/root/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/mvp/diagnosis_bias_scatter.png)\n16\t\n17\t## 趋势\n18\t成功 1 / 负向 2 / 失败 0 / 共 3\n19\t\n20\t## 下一步\n21\t（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\n22\t\n23\t## 资源状态\n24\trtx6000-4x: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\n25\t\n26\t## 告警\n27\t（无）\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EfXZh7raQEWsUShTmBTzxa","session_id":"7b85d8bd-7258-4dfd-917f-e95cb5e144aa","uuid":"5b2796b7-8857-4504-a34b-6ddc3e4a3791","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:18:13.711Z"}
